---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<aside class="notes-panel" data-notes-panel aria-label="本文批注">
  <div class="notes-head">
    <h2 class="notes-title">
      批注
      <span class="notes-count" data-notes-count>0</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="notes-actions">
      <button class="chip-btn" type="button" data-notes-export>
        <Icon name="download" size={11} />
        导出
      </button>
      <button class="chip-btn toc-close" type="button" data-drawer-close aria-label="收起">
        <Icon name="close" size={11} />
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="notes-hint">选中正文任意一句，即可留下批注。批注只存在你的浏览器里，可随时导出。</p>

  <ul class="notes-list" data-notes-list role="list"></ul>

  <p class="notes-empty" data-notes-empty>还没有批注。读到会心处，随手记一笔。</p>
</aside>
